    // after the required full suite found `ws08_r3::t2_facts_written_on_one_owner_machine_are_honoured_on_the_
    // others_and_refused_elsewhere` failing and misread the shape as a T2/`machine_view` cross-machine hazard.
    // Instrumented reproduction (P2-AR-0081) found the true mechanism instead: no T2 seal in that scenario is
